{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "g-phone",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "📱 手机端",
   "x": -18,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 674,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p-automate",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Automate「Phone Usage Logger」\n• 采集: 前台包名 / 亮灭屏 / 心跳（最小事实）\n• 位置: 手机常驻 Flow（开机启动）\n• 每 15 分钟 PUT 上传，X-Upload-Token 鉴权\n• 故障: 心跳缺失 >30min → 手机端自检（10.3）",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "p-bridge",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Focus Bridge 1.3.3(18)\n• 介入桥接: 15s 轮询 pending + 5min 心跳\n• 10s 原生选择页（接受/拒绝/忽略）\n• 执行「不做手机控」并回传 final\n• 请求级幂等账本 + 24h 完成墓碑",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 137,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "p-getaway",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "「不做手机控」APP\n• 快速番茄/专注的实际执行端\n• 由桥接打开，不负责心跳/唤醒",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 274,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 81,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "p-ntfy",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "ntfy APP（手机）\n• 订阅 ntfy.sh 私有主题\n• 仅展示通知（深夜/15:00/维护等）",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 381,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 81,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "p-feedback",
   "color": "1",
   "text": "人工反馈入口（手机/浏览器）\n• POST /annotation 半小时报告纠错（Bearer）\n• Next Action 反馈: responses / outcomes\n• 网页问题: issue-feedback",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 488,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-tablet",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "📟 平板端",
   "x": 474,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 201,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "t-tablet",
   "color": "2",
   "text": "平板 MatePad（⚠️ 待确认）\n• USB 投屏（QtScrcpy）用于线上授课，非数据采集\n• 文档存在 tablet_* 上传接口与 tablet_facts\n  但近期文档称平板不作为提醒触发设备\n• 详见: QtScrcpy与华为平板USB反复断连排查复盘.md",
   "x": 492,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-pc",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "💻 电脑端（Windows）",
   "x": 966,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 567,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-aw",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "ActivityWatch 采集 + 同步\n• aw-watcher-window/afk → aw-server :5600\n• 计划任务每 5 分钟 push → Syncthing 镜像 Pi\n• 分类规则 categories-v5.json（层级深度优先）",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-obsidian",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Obsidian + Pi Context Sync 插件\n• 任务/Profile/番茄钟 Markdown = 唯一事实源\n• Context Exporter 每 20 分钟导出上下文\n• 插件是唯一 Markdown 写入者（单向）",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 122,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-pomodoro",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "New Pomodoro Timer 插件\n• 5s 同步 Pi /api/bootstrap（Pi 会话权威）\n• Work 默认 40 分钟（1🍅=40min）\n• start/pause/resume → :8460",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 244,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-agent",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "介入 Agent + Cold Turkey\n• 5s 轮询 pending → 弹窗 → 封锁 → final 回执\n• allowlist: 常刷网站 / bilibili（30min）\n• 5min heartbeat\n• ⚠️ 启动形态（计划任务）待确认",
   "x": 984,
   "y": 366,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 111,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-net",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "🌐 网络边界（Tailscale）",
   "x": 1458,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 308,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-funnel",
   "color": "5",
   "text": "Funnel :443（公网，唯一对外入口）\n• 手机上传 /upload/*.jsonl + /annotation\n• Focus Bridge /focus-bridge/* 固定白名单\n• 其余服务一律不暴露公网",
   "x": 1476,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "n-serve",
   "color": "5",
   "text": "Tailscale Serve（tailnet-only）\n• :8450 → advisor-web :8767（Next Action）\n• :8460 → focus-garden :8838（花园）\n• :8443 → Monaco Lite :8766（规则编辑）",
   "x": 1476,
   "y": 122,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-pi",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "🖥️ 树莓派（Pi 3B）",
   "x": 1950,
   "y": -64,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 796,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-recv",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "phone-usage-receiver :8765\n• Funnel 443 入口；token 校验 + 去重归档\n• incoming/ + archive/YYYY-MM-DD\n• 维护 timer 03:30（30 天压缩/365 天删除）",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-syncthing",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "syncthing@conrad.service\n• 接收: activitywatch-sync / behavior-context-sync\n• 发送: focus-garden-archive 快照（send-only）\n• 单向同步，禁止双向写 SQLite",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 122,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-halfhour",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "半小时处理链（08/38 分触发）\n• facts → 合并 → 标签 → 语义时间线 → 指标\n• → AI 报告 ai_reports/ → 影子干预候选\n• would_intervene=true → ntfy 半小时提醒",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 244,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-life",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "生活统计与提醒 timers\n• 日报 09/10/11 · 周报 周一 09:05\n• 深夜 00:30–04:30 · 15:00 任务检查\n• 系统维护守护 每 3 分钟",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 366,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-web",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "Next Action Web :8767 → :8450\n• 建议生成（V4 Pro thinking）+ 2 轮澄清\n• 任务 mutation queue / 近期动态\n• 介入 API / issue-feedback / heartbeat",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 488,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "pi-garden",
   "color": "4",
   "text": "专注花园 focus-garden :8838 → :8460\n• Pi 权威 SQLite（唯一写入端）\n• NextAction 代理（loopback :8767 白名单）\n• 备份 timer 每分钟 → 快照镜像",
   "x": 1968,
   "y": 610,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 96,
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-ext",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "☁️ 外部服务",
